{"id":"c749f46fbad31f8b","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-jump-operator-def.md","title":"Jump Operator Definition","display":"df-jump-operator-def — Jump Operator Definition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-jump-operator-def","aliases":["88-df-jump-operator-def"],"display":"df-jump-operator-def — Jump Operator Definition","depends_on":["[[88-df-turing-jump]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-jump-operator-def"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-jump-operator-def</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-jump-operator-def — Jump Operator Definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2b6a4a081d493b4c\" href=\"?note=2b6a4a081d493b4c\" title=\"88-df-turing-jump\">88-df-turing-jump</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb{N}\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;\">\\(A&#39;\\)</span> (Turing jump, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b6a4a081d493b4c\" href=\"?note=2b6a4a081d493b4c\" title=\"88-df-turing-jump\">88-df-turing-jump</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:\\mathcal{P}(\\mathbb{N})\\to\\mathcal{P}(\\mathbb{N})\">\\(J:\\mathcal{P}(\\mathbb{N})\\to\\mathcal{P}(\\mathbb{N})\\)</span> (jump operator)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jump\\text{-}operator\\text{-}def} \\vdash\nJ\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A,A&#39;\\rangle:A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jump\\text{-}operator\\text{-}def} \\vdash\nJ\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A,A&#39;\\rangle:A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(A)=A&#39;\">\\(J(A)=A&#39;\\)</span>，因此本文件只承载集合层面的跳算子</li>\n<li>Jump操作产生更高的不可判定度</li>\n<li>Jump操作是递归理论的核心概念</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-turing-jump","status":"resolved","id":"2b6a4a081d493b4c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-turing-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-jump","status":"resolved","id":"2b6a4a081d493b4c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A'$ (Turing jump, see [[88-df-turing-jump]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"A'","display":false},{"tex":"J:\\mathcal{P}(\\mathbb{N})\\to\\mathcal{P}(\\mathbb{N})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jump\\text{-}operator\\text{-}def} \\vdash\nJ\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A,A'\\rangle:A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\}","display":true},{"tex":"J(A)=A'","display":false}],"bytes":763,"backlinks":[{"id":"6587ae27f7ed289f","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$J:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)$ 见 [[88-df-jump-operator-def]]。"},{"id":"df7d22df7a30dedc","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$J(A)$ (set-level Turing jump, see [[88-df-jump-operator-def]])"},{"id":"5e3111fd9385df4f","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$J$ 见 [[88-df-jump-operator-def]]；$\\bigoplus$ 见 [[88-df-effective-join]]。"},{"id":"07bb4f1dbc54e232","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends